{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-concept-1ed88ac0", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "In how many papers is Lepton charge misidentification uncertainty (cross section ratio) recorded as systematic uncertainty?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records Lepton charge misidentification uncertainty (cross section ratio) as a systematic uncertainty in 34 papers. Here are some examples of the results that mention this systematic uncertainty:\n\n1. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:9c4ad1c1c70db6b8ce38a925`\n\n2. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:4e80317173e50c4874c171eb`\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:237cb750e6e81213249081cc`\n\n3. **Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:7d38c41becbc2f669173b1c6`\n\n4. **Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:5701459d96d2b35594f09829`\n\n5. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\(pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}\\) production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:019a3fe2db04e5ae8fd751f7`\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:c2c7d1311b9ab07c3f801c01`\n\n6. **General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:2b23b8542cafb4f0821f6d4d`\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:e1fe6cf1593983acb19baf3c`\n\n7. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\(b\\) final state**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:602321ce7e6f0a4b162cbc7a`\n\n8. **Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\(t\\bar{t}Z\\) production in \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:9cc04f40aae6a8a452be447e`\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:59b90a61dd9fdf6466bed63c`\n\n9. **Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\(t\\bar{t}\\) production measured in \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\) TeV \\(pp\\) collisions with the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Assertion ID: `he", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2508.13900", "2511.11853", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Lepton charge misidentification uncertainty", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.379}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.051}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 77, "error": null, "seconds": 0.012}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:syst:pileup_jet_id", "hepkg:systematic:ak4_btag_misid_rate", "hepkg:systematic:btag-deepjet", "hepkg:systematic:btag-efficiency", "hepkg:s