{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-concept-4099bb58", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Count the analyses that estimate a background using Discrete profiling method for background m_gg modelling.", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 6 analyses that estimate a background using the Discrete profiling method for background m_gg modelling. These analyses are found in the following papers: \n- 2004.04545: '$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector'\n- 2106.14246: 'Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$'\n- 2112.03161: 'Search for heavy resonances decaying to a pair of Lorentz-boosted Higgs bosons in final states with leptons and a bottom quark pair at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$'\n- 2207.00348: 'Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139$ fb -1 of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment'\n- 2302.05225: 'Searches for lepton-flavour-violating decays of the Higgs boson into $e\\tau$ and $\\mu\\tau$\nin $\\sqrt{s}=13$  TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector'\n- 2404.06204: 'Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum\nspectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ TeV and $13$ TeV'", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.0