{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-03b67d7d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $p_{\\text{T}}^{Z}$?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following 8 analyses measured Differential $t\\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $p_{\\text{T}}^{Z}$:\n\n1. **2312.04450**: *Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations*\n2. **2401.05299**: *Absolute differential cross-section vs $N_{\\mathrm{jets}}$ result*\n3. **2401.05299**: *Absolute differential cross-section vs $H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\mathrm{jet}}$ result*\n4. **2401.05299**: *Absolute differential cross-section vs $H_{\\mathrm{T}}^{\\mathrm{lep}}$ result*\n5. **2401.05299**: *Absolute differential cross-section vs $\\Delta R_{\\ell b,\\,\\textrm{lead}}$ result*\n6. **2401.05299**: *Absolute differential cross-section vs $|\\Delta\\phi_{\\ell\\ell,\\,\\textrm{SS}}|$ result*\n7. **2401.05299**: *Absolute differential cross-section vs $|\\Delta\\eta_{\\ell\\ell,\\,\\textrm{SS}}|$ result*\n8. **2402.08486**: *Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$*", "answered": true, "papers": ["2103.04956", "2110.11231", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2408.03744"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Differential t tbar Z cross section vs pT^Z", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.404}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "ro