{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-0f3e79dc", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses used the sample Single-top simulation sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses used the sample \"Single-top simulation sample (Powheg Box v2 + Pythia 8)\":\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2009.04363**: \"Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2309.14442**: \"Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of $t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n- **2402.08486**: \"Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2405.18661**: \"CMS Drell-Yan forward-backward asymmetry and effective weak mixing angle measurement at 13 TeV\"\n- **2604.21670**: \"Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state\"\n\nThese are the distinct p