{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-0f9ae25a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region H->4l fiducial phase space (particle level)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"H->4l fiducial phase space (particle level)\" or similar:\n\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a Z boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV.\n- **2103.04956**: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2112.00895**: Measurements of the associated production of a W boson and a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=8\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton $t\\bar{t}$ production measured in $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a W boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2309.14442**: Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of $t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b}$ production in the lepton+jets channel at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2408.03744**: Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for W and Z boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13 TeV.\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV}$.\n\nThese analyses define various regions that match the description \"H->4l fiducial phase space (particle level)\" or similar. Each of these papers includes results that define such regions.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2009.14537", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2112.00895", "2202.08676", "2207.00348", "2303.15340", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "H->4l fiducial phase space (particle level)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.427}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 31, "error": null, "seconds": 0.034}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:672f1e37310a4b762adc7a8c", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:1724c3004deb2fe7c06e27d8", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:f5b1d9536f2db25c7969a697", "hepkg:result:98870936d56c0284b1c0a718"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:4l-zz-cr", "hepkg:region:baseline_4l_selection", "hepkg:region:c