t", "the", "three-lepton", "tilde", "top", "transverse", "ttb", "ttbb", "ttbbj", "ttbj", "tth", "two-body", "two-lepton", "used", "using", "validation", "vbf", "vector", "veto", "via", "volume", "with", "y_h", "zz-", "zz-candidate"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 4, "prompt_tokens": 25899, "completion_tokens": 1084, "rounds": 4, "seconds": 43.88650884386152, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 43.88650884386152, "llm_calls": 4.0, "tokens": 26983.0, "rounds": 4.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "set_precision": 0.1, "set_recall": 1.0, "set_f1": 0.18181818181818182, "tool_calls": 3.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 78.0, "evidence_quotes": 31.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-106744ab", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Other backgrounds (diboson, $tZ$, $t\\bar{t}H$, $t\\bar{t}W$, $tWZ$)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background \"Other backgrounds (diboson, $tZ$, $t\\\\bar{t}H$, $t\\\\bar{t}W$, $tWZ$)\" or related backgrounds:\n\n1. **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector.\n2. **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$.\n3. **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state.\n4. **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector.\n5. **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations.\n6. **2405.18661**: CMS ttbar+W (ttW) associated production cross section measurement.\n7. **2510.07527**: HH->bb tautau analysis result.\n8. **2510.07527**: HH->multilepton analysis result.\n9. **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$.\n10. **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state.\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson production, top quark production, and searches for new phenomena. Each of these analyses estimates various backgrounds, including the ones mentioned in your query.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Other backgrounds (diboson, tZ, ttH, ttW, tWZ)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.462}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 116, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:ttw_measurement", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbtautau", "hepkg:result:multilepton", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78"]}, "rows": 10, "error": null, "seconds": 0.01}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:Wt", "hepkg:background:bbbb_boosted_ttbar", "hepkg:background:bbtautau_ttbar", "hepkg:background:combinatorial-background", "hepkg:background:continuum-tth-th", "hepkg:background:diboson", "hepkg:background:diboson-2lOS", "hepkg:background:diboson-rjr", "hepkg:background:diboson-vv", "hepkg:background:diboson_background", "hepkg:background:diboson_nonww", "hepkg:background:diboson_vv", "hepkg:background:fake-hf-leptons", "hepkg:background:gjets_tth_had", "hepkg:background:minor-rare-backgrounds", "hepkg:background