{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-1afa4f10", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region VBF signal region (VBF-SR)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"VBF signal region\" (VBF-SR):\n\n- **2004.01678**: Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a \\( Z \\) Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV \\( pp \\) Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2009.14537**: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2304.08962**: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) TeV and 13 TeV\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2605.14245**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n\nThese analyses define various regions related to the VBF signal region, including different channels and categories.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "VBF signal region", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.367}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 52, "error": null, "seconds": 0.032}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:9d25af0f1177d39097fa3f12", "hepkg:result:694974132a345b577852238c", "hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339", "hepkg:result:dd53bd1f0b8e16150e060072"]}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.013}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:2l-ss-sr", "hepkg:region:2lss_sr", "hepkg:region:3l-sr", "hepkg:region:SR-DM_scalar", "hepkg:region:SR-bWN", "hepkg:region:SR-bffN_btag", "hepkg:region:SR-bffN_softb", "hepkg:region:SR-tN_diag_high", "hepkg:region:SR-tN_diag_low", "hepkg:region:SR-tN_high", "hepkg:region:SR-tN_med", "hepkg:region:bbgamgam_vbf", "hepkg:region:bbww4q_vbf_sr", "hepkg:region:bbzz_4