{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-1e891a79", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background $W{+}\\text{jets}$ background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the $W{+}\\text{jets}$ background:\n\n- **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2008.05928**: \"Search for Heavy Resonances Decaying into a Photon and a Hadronically Decaying Higgs Boson in $pp$ Collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2202.08676**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2308.02285**: \"Measurement of the production cross section for a $W$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n- **2404.06204**: \"Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02\\,\\text{TeV}$ and $13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2408.03744**: \"Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $W$ and $Z$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV\"\n- **2503.19420**: \"Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{*}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2602.18611**: \"Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2604.27044**: \"Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state\"\n\nThese papers cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson production, top quark production, and searches for new physics. Each of these analyses includes the estimation of the $W{+}\\text{jets}$ background as part of their methodology.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "W + jets", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 22, "error": null, "seconds": 0.259}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 50, "error": null, "seconds": 0.048}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404", "hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339", "hepkg:result:1b05d75dca9cf140bac022d5"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.012}], "sets": {"set_1