{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-348f1f6a", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region CRTTZ?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region CRTTZ:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic $t\\bar{t}$ plus missing transverse momentum final state at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\,\\text{Te\\kern-1.00006ptV}$ with the ATLAS detector\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2304.08962**: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2503.19420**: Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into $WW^{\\ast}$ with the ATLAS detector at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV\n- **2511.11853**: Search for a new neutral gauge boson produced in association with one or two b jets and decaying into a pair of muons in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2403.01556", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2509.22535", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "CRTTZ", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.308}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 62, "error": null, "seconds": 0.037}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a", "hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e", "hepkg:result:694974132a345b577852238c", "hepkg:result:a1be093dbc0132aef0ad80b2", "hepkg:result:260119c5314b01ee54efcb2b"]}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "seconds": 0.011}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:2lep_cr_emu", "hepkg:region:3l-ttz-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-wz-0jet-cr", "hepkg:region:3l-wz-1jet-cr", "hepkg:region:3lA_offz_sr", "hepkg:region:4l-zz-cr", "hepkg:region:CR-ttbar", "hepkg:region:CR_2j_ee", "hepkg:region:CR_j", "hepkg:region:CR_j_ee", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_b", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_c", "hepkg:region:CR_ttbar_light", "hepkg:region:SR_ttZ_Zcc", "hepkg:region:control_region", "hepkg:region:cr-2body-ttbar", "hepkg:reg