", "squarks", "stairway", "state", "states", "stxs", "supersymmetric", "supersymmetry", "system", "tag", "tagging", "tau", "test", "tev", "text", "the", "theory", "three", "top", "total", "track", "track-based", "track-jet", "tracks", "transverse", "triple", "ttbar", "two", "universality", "using", "validation", "vbf", "vector", "vector-like", "vertex", "veto", "via", "weak", "with", "yukawa"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 4, "prompt_tokens": 23830, "completion_tokens": 890, "rounds": 4, "seconds": 35.31952284602448, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 35.31952284602448, "llm_calls": 4.0, "tokens": 24720.0, "rounds": 4.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 1.0, "abstained": 0.0, "refused_in_text": 0.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "set_precision": 0.034482758620689655, "set_recall": 1.0, "set_f1": 0.06666666666666667, "tool_calls": 3.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 114.0, "evidence_quotes": 213.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-536d7b73", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background $t\\bar{t}H$ background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 20 analyses that estimate the $t\\bar{t}H$ background. Here are some of the specific analyses:\n\n1. **$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:1f350525446c8e551c091002`\n\n2. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:0354311dee741d58c7da9413`\n\n3. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:66af778434192efb2763ab9a`\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:005859ed7d741c5e98989033`\n\n4. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:36e5e07018b93ebbc7366efd`\n\n5. **Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:dd87e550a356415448d64d58`\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:7b53e9a0da07c88709622603`\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:8d4a0dd66fb82f996c233b7a`\n\n6. **Measurement of the production cross section for a $W$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:f7722ac9ad64ae6a73004de5`\n\n7. **Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139$ fb$^{-1}$ of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:d70dff09bd33931c8fc87396`\n\n8. **Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:bfe16f48204f5cf463f1f0f2`\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:f86c0973898b11647fdbc0f6`\n   - Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2211.08028", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "t tbar H", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 19, "error": null, "seconds": 0.278}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 37, "error": null, "seconds": 0.008}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:continuum-tth-th", "hepkg:background:ggf_contamination", "hepkg:background:minor-rare-backgrounds", "hepkg:background:other", "hepkg:background:other-higgs", "hepkg:background:other_higgs", "hepkg:background:others", "hepkg:background:others-minor", "hepkg:background:rare-processes", "hepkg:background:ttH", "hepkg:background:ttV", "hepkg:background:ttbar", "hepkg:background:ttbar-w-z-h", "hepkg:background:ttbarZ", "hepkg:background:tth", "hepkg:background:tttt", "hepkg:background:tttt-bkg", "hepkg:background:ttw", "hepkg:background:ttw-bkg", "hepkg:background:ttz-bkg", "hepkg:background:ttz-gammastar", "hepkg:background:zz_h_prompt"]}, "entity_ids"