{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-5dcdb138", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Colour reconnection model uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses report the systematic uncertainty 'Colour reconnection model uncertainty':\n\n- 2009.04363: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- 2111.08340: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\n- 2205.05120: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- 2402.08486: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2504.13081: Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2510.07527: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- 2604.21670: Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark\n- 2605.14245: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553