{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-5f8d7d10", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Observed and background-only-fit expected event yields in signal regions?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 18 distinct analyses that measured Observed and background-only-fit expected event yields in signal regions. Here are the papers that reported these observables:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Measured 95% CL upper limit on number of BSM signal events (S_obs^95, S_exp^95), Discovery p-value p(s=0) and local significance (Z) for background-only hypothesis, and Observed vs expected event yield in a signal region (discovery/exclusion fit).\n- **2006.05880**: Measured Observed number of events in a signal region and Total post-fit SM background yield in a signal region.\n- **2007.02873**: Measured Significance of background-only hypothesis rejection for VH, WH, and ZH, H→bb production, and VH, V→leptons production cross-section times H→bb branching fraction in reduced STXS regions.\n- **2010.14293**: Measured Observed and background-only-fit expected event yields in signal regions, 95% CL observed/expected upper limit on number of BSM signal events (S_obs^95, S_exp^95), One-sided p-value (p0) / significance (Z) of background-only hypothesis per signal region, and Data vs. background significance in validation regions.\n- **2012.01581**: Measured Predicted background yield in the final signal region and Observed event count in the final signal region.\n- **2012.03799**: Measured Per-signal-region observed event yield, predicted SM background, background-only compatibility (p0, local Z significance), and model-independent 95% CL upper limit on the number of beyond-SM events.\n- **2102.01444**: Measured 95% CL upper limit on the visible number of signal events (S_obs^95, S_exp^95).\n- **2106.01676**: Measured SM WZ background normalisation factor extracted from control regions in profile-likelihood fit, Local significance of observed-vs-expected yield deviation in a signal region, and Background-only hypothesis discovery p-value and significance Z in a signal region.\n- **2206.09466**: Measured Observed (expected) significance of Higgs boson signal per production mode in H→WW.\n- **2307.01094**: Measured Observed and expected event yield in each signal region, Significance of deviation between observed and background-expected yields per signal region, and Model-independent 95% CL upper limits on visible BSM cross section and signal event yield (σ_vis, S_obs^95, S_exp^95) per signal region.\n- **2403.01556**: Measured Observed and estimated background event yield in signal/validation regions.\n\nThese papers cover a range of observables related to observed and background-only-fit expected event yields in signal regions.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2307.01094", "2401.07090", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2503.19420", "2508.13900", "2511.11853"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Observed and background-only-fit expected event yields in signal regions", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 47, "error": null, "seconds": 0.342}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.05}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_set": "set_1", "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 0, "error": null, "seconds": 0.008}, {"round": 4, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:sr-event-yield", "hepkg:observable:event_yield", "hepkg:observable:sr-significance", "hepkg:observable:observed_event_count_signal_region", "hepkg:observable:local-si