{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-68c2f6c1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty tau_h energy scale uncertainty (decay-mode dependent, 0.2%-1.1%)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 49 analyses that report the systematic uncertainty related to the tau_h energy scale (decay-mode dependent, 0.2%-1.1%). Here are some of the specific analyses:\n\n1. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:9c4ad1c1c70db6b8ce38a925`)\n2. **Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:4cecba2996e7b0359beb76bf`, `hepkg:assertion:f0bb64dc6dab4fae1c7449b1`, `hepkg:assertion:87cf0dde696217904e1d8927`)\n3. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:1bf46d0aa15a3c1126fc2786`, `hepkg:assertion:cb02a03c23fc4398fed20222`, `hepkg:assertion:4af906e1c137a502ad6b6a9f`)\n4. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\(H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}\\) decays in the ATLAS detector** (Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:4efbeee916cb051a83e4ae0a`, `hepkg:assertion:b1da85d3c396c7dba65061f8`)\n5. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state** (Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:04122570ae9a561b34be3b5a`, `hepkg:assertion:cca8e3e3747516da92acea82`, `hepkg:assertion:4087bb290c0e97b59a32839d`, `hepkg:assertion:7bef5acc1f70d12de970cf06`, `hepkg:assertion:d2993ddff99