{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-6a67f2f4", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured f_a3^ggH effective CP-odd Hgg cross section fraction?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph contains several results that measure observables related to the CP-mixing angle in the effective Higgs-gluon (Hgg) coupling. Here are the analyses that measure this observable:\n\n1. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450`)\n2. **Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437`)\n3. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556`)\n4. **Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe`)\n5. **Effective coupling modifier fit assuming no additional BSM decays** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:coupling_effective_bsm0`)\n6. **Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad`)\n7. **HH->WWgamgam analysis result** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:wwgamgam`)\n8. **HH->bb gamgam analysis result** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:bbgamgam`)\n9. **HH->bb tautau analysis result** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:bbtautau`)\n10. **HH->bbWW, WW->4q all-hadronic analysis result** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:bbww_4q`)\n11. **HH->bbWW, WW->lvqq/2l2nu analysis result** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:bbww_lvqq_2l2nu`)\n12. **HH->bbZZ(4l) analysis result** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:bbzz`)\n13. **HH->gamgamtautau analysis result** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:gamgamtautau`)\n14. **HH->multilepton analysis result** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:multilepton`)\n15. **Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878`)\n16. **Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( W \\) and \\( Z \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13 TeV** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404`)\n\nThese", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2209.07327", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2504.13081", "2510.07527", "2602.18611"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "f_a3^ggH effective CP-odd Hgg cross section fraction", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.42}, {"round": 2, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "f_a3^ggH effective CP-odd Hgg cross section fraction", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.423}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_2"}, "rows": 75, "error": null, "seconds": 0.047}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_effective", "hepkg:observable:coupling_symmetry_updown", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_pt_h", "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_y_h", "hepkg:observable:dm-xsec-upper-limit-ratio", "hepkg:observable:dsigma-deta-particle", "hepk