{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-6bb72043", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured f_Lambda1 (HVV effective fractional cross section)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph contains several results that measure observables related to the Higgs boson and other processes, but none of them explicitly mention \"f_Lambda1\" (HVV effective fractional cross section). Here are the results that measure observables which might be related:\n\n1. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450`)\n2. **Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437`)\n3. **Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH->4b result** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:combined-run2-run3`)\n4. **Combined Run 3 resolved+merged HH->4b result** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:combined-run3`)\n5. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\(H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}\\) decays in the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556`)\n6. **Coupling modifier ratio fit** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:coupling_modifier_ratios`)\n7. **Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad`)\n8. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\(pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}\\) production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19`)\n9. **Fiducial \\(t\\bar{t}W\\) cross-section measurement result** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:ttw-fiducial-xsec`)\n10. **Fiducial WZ production cross section measurement (combined flavour categories)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:wz-fiducial-xsec`)\n11. **Higgs boson trilinear self-coupling constraint via NLO EW corrections** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:higgs_selfcoupling_fit`)\n12. **Inclusive and differential cross section measurements of \\(t\\bar{t}b\\bar{b}\\) production in the lepton+jets channel at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:a6cd17820e382d3557564ac2`)\n13. **Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\(t\\bar{t}Z\\) production in \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878`)\n\nHowever, none of these results explicitly measure \"f_Lambda1\" (HVV effective fractional cross section). \n\nTo provide a definitive answer, let's check if any of these results are part of papers that might have measured \"f_Lambda1\".\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"papers_of\", \"arguments\": {\"entity", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2103.04956", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2408.03744", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "f_Lambda1", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 36, "error": null, "seconds": 0.254}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.041}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:AC_llbar", "hepkg:observable:AC_ttbar", "hepkg:observable:branching-fraction-h-mumu", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_ratio", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_resolved", "hepkg:observable:coupling_symmetry_leptonquark", "hepkg:observable:fid_xsec_z", "hepkg:observable:fiducial-cross-section-ee-plus-p", "hepkg:observable:fiducial-cross-section-mumu-plus-p", "hepkg:observable:fiducial_xsec_inclusive