{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-6ca234d7", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Others background (prompt single charmonium + non-resonant di-muon with fake muons)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background \"Others background (prompt single charmonium + non-resonant di-muon with fake muons)\" or similar backgrounds:\n\n- **2004.04545**: \"$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector\"\n- **2007.02873**: \"Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2110.11231**: \"Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${W}{Z}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${p}{p}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2111.08340**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2202.08676**: \"Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\"\n- **2205.05120**: \"Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2206.09466**: \"Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $W$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2207.00348**: \"Measurement of the properties of Higgs boson production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ in the $H\\to\\gamma\\gamma$ channel using $139\\,\\text{fb}^{-1}$ of $pp$ collision data with the ATLAS experiment\"\n- **2208.12095**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2308.02285**: \"Measurement of the production cross section for a $W$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$\"\n- **2312.04450**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n- **2401.05299**: \"Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$ with the ATLAS detector\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"HH->bbWW, WW->lvqq/2l2nu analysis result\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"HH->bbZZ(4l) analysis result\"\n- **2510.07527**: \"HH->WWgamgam analysis result\"\n- **2604.21670**: \"Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2404.06204", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Others background (prompt single charmonium + non-resonant di-muon with fake muons)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 51, "error": null, "seconds": 0.431}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 95, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hep