{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-700a651e", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Charge misidentification background, SS dilepton channel?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph indicates that the analysis reported in the paper with arXiv ID 2208.12095, titled \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector,\" estimates the background \"Charge misidentification background\" in the \"SS dilepton channel.\"\n\nHowever, the comparison between the background \"Charge misidentification background\" and the final state \"SS dilepton channel\" shows that no other analyses in the graph estimate this specific background in this specific final state.\n\nTherefore, the only analysis that estimates the \"Charge misidentification background\" in the \"SS dilepton channel\" is:\n\n- **Paper**: 2208.12095\n- **Title**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n\nThis is the only analysis in the graph that meets the criteria.\n\nAnswer: The analysis reported in the paper with arXiv ID 2208.12095, titled \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector,\" estimates the \"Charge misidentification background\" in the \"SS dilepton channel.\" No other analyses in the graph cover this specific combination.\n\nAnswerable: True\nReason: answered", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "22