{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-80008fd1", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Color reconnection (CR) model uncertainty (MPI-early-res-on, gluon-move, QCD-inspired)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 47 distinct analyses that report the systematic uncertainty \"Color reconnection (CR) model uncertainty (MPI-early-res-on, gluon-move, QCD-inspired)\" or related uncertainties. Here are some of the specific analyses:\n\n1. **Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437`)\n2. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8`)\n3. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\(H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}\\) decays in the ATLAS detector** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556`)\n4. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044`)\n5. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b`)\n6. **Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Result ID: `hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe`)\n7. **Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving 