{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-9bf1f695", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region 2ℓ SS Signal Region?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"2ℓ SS Signal Region\":\n\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons.\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector.\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2303.15340**: Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\( t\\bar{t} \\) production measured in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector.\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2508.13900**: General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\).\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for n