t", "templates", "text", "textrm", "the", "tight", "tight-to-loose", "top", "total", "training", "transfer", "transfer-factor", "triboson", "ttbar", "ttg", "tth", "ttt", "tttt", "ttw", "ttww", "tw-associated", "tw-channel", "twz", "unconstrained", "uncorrelated", "using", "validated", "vbf-like", "via", "vvv", "window", "with", "without", "yield", "z-mass", "z-peak", "zgamma", "zjj"], "verification_score": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": [], "llm_calls": 4, "prompt_tokens": 21171, "completion_tokens": 158, "rounds": 4, "seconds": 9.373967797961086, "error": ""}, "scores": {"seconds": 9.373967797961086, "llm_calls": 4.0, "tokens": 21329.0, "rounds": 4.0, "errored": 0.0, "answered": 0.0, "abstained": 1.0, "refused_in_text": 1.0, "refusal_flag_disagrees": 0.0, "faithfulness": 1.0, "unsupported_claims": 0.0, "set_precision": 0.043478260869565216, "set_recall": 1.0, "set_f1": 0.08333333333333333, "tool_calls": 3.0, "tool_errors": 0.0, "tool_error_rate": 0.0, "retrieved_first": 1.0, "entities_retrieved": 163.0, "evidence_quotes": 117.0}}
{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-b43e0e3b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background ZZ irreducible background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the ZZ irreducible background:\n\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2205.05120**: Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2510.07527**: HH->multilepton analysis result\n- **2510.07527**: HH->bbZZ(4l) analysis result\n- **2602.18611**: Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2604.27044**: Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ final state\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics, including Higgs boson production, multilepton probes, and top quark production, among others. Each of these pa