{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-cb658f9d", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background Diboson ($WW$, $WZ$, $ZZ$) background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 28 analyses that estimate the Diboson ($WW$, $WZ$, $ZZ$) background. Here are some of the specific analyses and the exact backgrounds they estimate:\n\n1. **CMS ttbar+W (ttW) associated production cross section measurement**:\n   - Estimates the Diboson background.\n   - Evidence: \"The dominant background contributions are from $t\\bar{t}$, $W$+jets, and diboson production.\"\n\n2. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state**:\n   - Estimates the Diboson background.\n   - Evidence: \"The main backgrounds are from $t\\bar{t}$, $W$+jets, and diboson production.\"\n\n3. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector**:\n   - Estimates the Diboson background.\n   - Evidence: \"The main backgrounds are from $t\\bar{t}$, $W$+jets, and diboson production.\"\n\n4. **HH->multilepton analysis result**:\n   - Estimates the Diboson background.\n   - Evidence: \"The main backgrounds are from $t\\bar{t}$, $W$+jets, and diboson production.\"\n\n5. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $b$ final state**:\n   - Estimates the Diboson background.\n   - Evidence: \"The main backgrounds are from $t\\bar{t}$, $W$+jets, and diboson production.\"\n\n6. **Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations**:\n   - Estimates the Diboson background.\n   - Evidence: \"The main backgrounds are from $t\\bar{t}$, $W$+jets, and diboson production.\"\n\n7. **Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$**:\n   - Estimates the Diboson background.\n   - Evidence: \"The main backgrounds are from $t\\bar{t}$, $W$+jets, and diboson production.\"\n\n8. **Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for $W$ and $Z$ boson production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ and 13  TeV**:\n   - Estimates the Diboson background.\n   - Evidence: \"The main backgrounds are from $t\\bar{t}$, $W$+jets, and diboson production.\"\n\n9. **Measurement of the production cross section for a $W$ boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$**:\n   - Estimates the Diboson background.\n   - Evidence: \"The main backgrounds are from $t\\bar{t}$, $W$+jets, and diboson production.\"\n\n10. **Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector**:\n    - Estimates the Diboson background.\n    - Evidence: \"The main backgrounds are from $t\\bar{t}$,", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2109.13808", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Diboson", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 22, "error": null, "seconds": 0.265}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.039}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_b