{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-db5182a4", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background ttbar background process?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses estimate the background ttbar process:\n\n- **2004.14060**: Search for a scalar partner of the top quark in the all-hadronic \\( t\\bar{t} \\) plus missing transverse momentum final state at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector\n- **2102.01444**: Search for new phenomena in events with two opposite-charge leptons, jets, and missing transverse momentum in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2106.01676**: Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum in \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV \\( pp \\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- **2106.14246**: Search for electroweak production of charginos and neutralinos in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2107.12553**: Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and \\( W \\) bosons using 137 \\( \\, \\text{fb}^{-1} \\) of proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential \\( WZ \\) production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the \\( W \\) boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2208.12095**: Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\( pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t} \\) production at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2308.02285**: Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( W \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\, \\text{TeV} \\)\n- **2312.04450**: Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) production in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) TeV and 13 TeV\n- **2405.18661**: CMS \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) associated production cross section measurement\n- **2405.18661**: CMS four top quark (\\( t\\bar{t}\\bar{t}\\bar{t} \\", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2102.01444", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2206.09466", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "ttbar", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "seconds": 0.27}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 38, "error": null, "seconds": 0.04}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:fourtop_measurement", "hepkg:result:ttw_measurement", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:bbtautau", "hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77", "hepkg:result:b5d7a4349aed174d446f3878", "hepkg:result:180d8e3ba064c02c9c16a8ae", 