{"run_id": "20260803T234732-hepkg-48227", "qid": "gen-conceptset-ffe60e39", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region Final signal region (Region H)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the region \"Final signal region (Region H)\":\n\n- **2004.01678**: Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector\n- **2009.04363**: Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n- **2009.14537**: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\n- **2011.07812**: Search for displaced leptons in $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector\n- **2107.12553**: Search for chargino-neutralino production in events with Higgs and $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ bosons using 137 $\\, \\text{fb}^{-1}$ of proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2206.09466**: Measurements of the Higgs boson production cross section and couplings in the $\\mathup{{{W}}}$ boson pair decay channel in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2304.08962**: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS detector\n- **2401.05299**: Measurement of the total and differential cross-sections of $t\\bar{t}W$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2402.08486**: Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n- **2404.06204**: Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=5.02$ TeV and $13$ TeV\n- **2407.10549**: Search for dark matter produced in association with a dark Higgs boson in the $b\\bar{b}$ final state using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector\n- **2510.07527**: Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\n\nThese are the distinct papers that define the region \"Final signal region (Region H)\" in their respective analyses.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2112.03161", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2209.07327", "2304.08962", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2504.13081", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2602.18611", "2604.21670"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Final signal region (Region H)", "kind": "event_region"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.381}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_region", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 43, "error": null, "seconds": 0.036}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe", "hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad", "hepkg:result:8e885d9541438f775548eee6", "hepkg:result:6b87d4fa6369adc316efb3b5", "hepkg:result:9d25af0f1177d39097fa3f12", "hepkg:result:694974132a345b577852238c", "hepkg:result:ed295e954b4df9d734d7c339", "hepkg:result:dd53bd1f0b8e16150e060072", "hepkg:result:4fc18dcf1fe256e1dbb021d9", "hepkg:result:ea06bc6559c38a7c9993e3b5", "hepkg:result:36007f1a5d23adf160cf4b1d"]}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "seconds": 0.012}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:region:2l-ss-sr", "hepkg:region:2lss_sr", "hepkg:region:3l-sr", "hepkg:region:SR-DM_scalar", "hepkg:region:SR-bWN", "hepkg:region: